  "description": "In a world where humans can be possessed by evil spirits, Hyeon-U works alongside Giram in an exorcism agency and quite literally beats the spirits out of people. Everything changes when he catches the attention of the Cascadic Church, which is trying to wreak havoc by unleashing evil spirits on the world. The Catholic order of Ordo reaches out to Hyeon-U, and now he must decide whether he’s willing to risk his life in order to stop the Cascadic Church.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
